wait-for Play with friends
# A failed download is said on Home at its level, with the control that
# fixes it, rather than in the same grey as a fresh pack.
scenario offline
tap Get more questions
wait-for not on Wi-Fi
clean
shot home-offline
scenario normal
tap About the questions
expect opentdb.com
clean
shot about
tap Back to packs
tap Play with friends
tap Choose players
tap 2
tap Start round
expect Ada's turn
clean
shot question
tap-id answer-0
expect Pass to Bert
clean
shot pass
tap-id show-question
expect Bert's turn
tap-id answer-0
expect Right answer
clean
shot reveal
